OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fshowers, locally heavy, move
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards across England and
OL,8,FWales, followed by clearer spells for
OL,9,Fnorthern England. Scotland and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland remain unsettled with
OL,11,Fblustery showers. Windy in the north
OL,12,Fwith gales in places. Mild in the
OL,13,Fsoutheast.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FHeavy rain slowly clearing
OL,16,Fthe southeast in the morning. A
OL,17,Fbrighter day for many and feeling
OL,18,Ffresh. Winds gradually easing in the
OL,19,Fnorth, with showers too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
